*Solution(s)/Idea(s)*
1. *Mandatory VAT% -* If its null it is not applicable, and if it has value then that value is used i.e. nothing is picked from invoice row.
Pros - Simpler, since business logic in API becomes cleaner (magic is removed of picking from first row)
Cons - for all the usages we will have to start sending this %'age
2. *Have a Flag -* If we have null applicable flag then the condition is not checked
Pros - We do not have to make changes to usages
Cons - We have to make business logic more complex.
3. *Have a VAT object* - We are not considering right now since object needs to be added everywhere, another form of 2.
